"1단계: 고전 입력을 양자 문제로 변환 {#step-1-map-classical-inputs-to-a-quantum-problem-2}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Now we will import an existing dataset for our classification. This dataset "
